    "After you copy, Copyo writes the item back to the system clipboard and hands focus back to the app you came from. You press ⌘V yourself — Copyo never pastes for you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Après la copie, Copyo remet l’élément dans le presse-papiers du système et rend la main à l’app d’où vous venez. C’est vous qui appuyez sur ⌘V — Copyo ne colle jamais à votre place."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制后 Copyo 把内容写回系统剪贴板并把焦点交还给原来的 App，由你自己按 ⌘V —— Copyo 从不代你粘贴。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "全部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always copy as plain text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours copier en texte brut"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终以纯文本复制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Always on": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toujours activé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any folder all of your devices share works — for example a folder inside iCloud Drive, or a company drive. Copyo keeps its files in its own subfolder and can only reach the folder you pick here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "N’importe quel dossier partagé par tous vos appareils convient — par exemple un dossier dans iCloud Drive ou un disque d’entreprise. Copyo place ses fichiers dans son propre sous-dossier et n’a accès qu’au dossier que vous choisissez ici."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "任意多台设备都能共享的文件夹皆可，例如 iCloud Drive 里的某个文件夹或公司共享盘。Copyo 会把自己的文件放在其中的专属子文件夹里，且只能访问你在此选定的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anything you copy shows up here. Copyo records it in the background — there is nothing you need to do.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tout ce que vous copiez apparaît ici. Copyo l’enregistre en arrière-plan, vous n’avez rien à faire."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制任何东西，它都会出现在这里。Copyo 在后台自动记录，不需要你做任何事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Applies when you press ↩. ⇧↩ always copies as plain text.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "S’applique quand vous appuyez sur ↩. ⇧↩ copie toujours en texte brut."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按 ↩ 时生效。⇧↩ 始终以纯文本复制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Available": {
