    "The combination must include at least one of ⌘, ⌥ or ⌃. Press Esc to cancel.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La combinaison doit contenir au moins ⌘, ⌥ ou ⌃. Appuyez sur Esc pour annuler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "组合键需要至少包含 ⌘、⌥ 或 ⌃ 其中之一，按 Esc 取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy in your iCloud private database was not touched, because iCloud sync is off. Set Sync to iCloud, reopen Copyo and delete again to remove it too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La copie présente dans votre base de données privée iCloud n’a pas été touchée, car la synchronisation iCloud est désactivée. Réglez « Synchronisation » sur iCloud, relancez Copyo et supprimez à nouveau pour l’effacer aussi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你 iCloud 私有数据库里的那份副本没有被动过，因为 iCloud 同步是关着的。把「同步」设为 iCloud、重新打开 Copyo 再删一次，才能把它也删掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current card is pinned to it once it’s created": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La carte actuelle y sera épinglée une fois créé"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "建好后把当前卡固定进去"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The folder was moved or renamed, or Copyo lost permission to it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le dossier a été déplacé ou renommé, ou Copyo n’y a plus accès."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目录被移走、改名或授权失效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same deletion is queued for your iCloud private database and your other Macs. Keep Copyo open and signed in to iCloud until it finishes — Copyo cannot tell you when that is.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La même suppression est mise en file d’attente pour votre base de données privée iCloud et vos autres Mac. Laissez Copyo ouvert et restez connecté à iCloud jusqu’à la fin — Copyo ne peut pas vous dire quand ce sera fait."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同样的删除已经排进队列，会发往你的 iCloud 私有数据库和你的其他 Mac。请让 Copyo 保持打开并保持 iCloud 登录状态直到发送完成——Copyo 无法告诉你那是什么时候。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac has synced with iCloud before. Copyo cannot touch the iCloud copy while sync is off — set Sync to iCloud, reopen Copyo and delete again to remove that copy too.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Mac a déjà été synchronisé avec iCloud. Copyo ne peut pas toucher à la copie iCloud tant que la synchronisation est désactivée — réglez « Synchronisation » sur iCloud, relancez Copyo et supprimez à nouveau pour effacer cette copie aussi."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 以前用过 iCloud 同步。同步关着的时候 Copyo 碰不到 iCloud 上那份副本——把「同步」设为 iCloud、重新打开 Copyo 再删一次，才能把那份也删掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Pinboard is empty": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce Pinboard est vide"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 Pinboard 还是空的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This combination is already used by another app. Restored to %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette combinaison est déjà utilisée par une autre app. Rétablie sur %@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个组合已被另一个 App 占用，已恢复为 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of Copyo is not signed for iCloud sync.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie de Copyo n’est pas signée pour la synchronisation iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份 Copyo 的签名不包含 iCloud 同步授权。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes every clipboard entry and every Pinboard, including everything pinned to them. This action cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les éléments du presse-papiers et tous les Pinboards seront supprimés, y compris ce qui y est épinglé. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除所有剪贴板记录和所有 Pinboard，包括固定在里面的内容。此操作不可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This deletes every clipboard entry that isn’t pinned to a Pinboard. Pinned entries and Pinboards are kept — use Delete All Data to remove those too. This action cannot be undone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tous les éléments du presse-papiers non épinglés à un Pinboard seront supprimés. Les éléments épinglés et les Pinboards sont conservés — utilisez « Supprimer toutes les données » pour les supprimer aussi. Cette action est irréversible."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将删除所有未固定到 Pinboard 的剪贴板记录。固定的内容和 Pinboard 会保留——要把它们一并删除，请用「删除所有数据」。此操作不可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try It Now": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Essayer"
          }
        },
