          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无限制"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unpin": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ne plus épingler"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消固定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until Copyo restarts, this Mac keeps sending your clipboard history to your iCloud private database. Copyo is also still sending the entries you deleted; whatever has not been sent when Copyo restarts stays in iCloud.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que Copyo n’a pas redémarré, ce Mac continue d’envoyer votre historique du presse-papiers vers votre base de données privée iCloud. Copyo est aussi encore en train d’envoyer les éléments que vous avez supprimés ; ce qui n’aura pas été envoyé au moment du redémarrage restera dans iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Copyo 重启之前，这台 Mac 仍会把你的剪贴板历史发送到你的 iCloud 私有数据库。Copyo 同时还在发送你删掉的那些条目；重启时还没发出去的部分会留在 iCloud 里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until Copyo restarts, this Mac keeps sending your clipboard history to your iCloud private database. If you don’t restart now, Copyo keeps using iCloud sync for the rest of this session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tant que Copyo n’a pas redémarré, ce Mac continue d’envoyer votre historique du presse-papiers vers votre base de données privée iCloud. Si vous ne redémarrez pas maintenant, Copyo continuera d’utiliser la synchronisation iCloud pendant tout le reste de cette session."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 Copyo 重启之前，这台 Mac 仍会把你的剪贴板历史发送到你的 iCloud 私有数据库。如果现在不重启，本次会话余下的时间里 Copyo 会继续使用 iCloud 同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Copyo": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bienvenue dans Copyo"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Copyo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the limit is exceeded, the oldest unpinned entries are removed automatically. Anything pinned to a Pinboard is unaffected.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au-delà de la limite, les éléments non épinglés les plus anciens sont supprimés automatiquement. Les éléments épinglés à un Pinboard ne sont pas concernés."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "超出上限时最旧的未固定记录会被自动清理，固定到 Pinboard 的内容不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this is off, press %@ or open Copyo again in Finder to get back to Settings": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si cette option est désactivée, appuyez sur %@ ou rouvrez Copyo dans le Finder pour retrouver les réglages"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关闭后可按 %@ 或在访达中再次打开 Copyo 找回设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your clipboard history stays on this Mac only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre historique du presse-papiers reste uniquement sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "剪贴板历史只保存在这台 Mac 上，不做任何同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your history lives only on this Mac and in the sync location you choose. Copyo collects no data.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Votre historique reste uniquement sur ce Mac et à l’emplacement de synchronisation que vous choisissez. Copyo ne collecte aucune donnée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的历史只存在这台 Mac 和你自己选的同步位置里，Copyo 不收集任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Account": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Compte iCloud"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 账户"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud Drive is turned off on this Mac. Turn it on in System Settings, or choose another folder.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud Drive est désactivé sur ce Mac. Activez-le dans Réglages Système ou choisissez un autre dossier."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台 Mac 没有打开 iCloud Drive。请在系统设置里打开，或者另选一个文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud is in sync": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
